00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:50.928 line:0%
You're basically saying
that he will win,

00:18:50.928 --> 00:18:52.130 line:0%
but they'll steal it?

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:54.432 line:0%
[ Laughing ] Is that
what you're predicting?

00:18:54.432 --> 00:18:56.234 line:0%
-I'm saying he better win
by 4% or 5%

00:18:56.234 --> 00:18:59.070 line:0%
to make sure he actually
gets the victory there.

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:00.539 line:0%
I think that's the margin
he'd need

00:19:00.539 --> 00:19:02.941 line:0%
to avoid what they will
systematically do.

00:19:02.941 --> 00:19:04.876 line:0%
-It's anticipatory

00:19:04.876 --> 00:19:06.545 line:0%
to say that there's going
to be cheating,

00:19:06.545 --> 00:19:07.979 line:0%
when we haven't
seen it happen yet.

00:19:07.979 --> 00:19:11.082 line:0%
Why are you
so confident of that?

00:19:11.082 --> 00:19:12.650 line:0%
-Well, first
of [ Chuckling ] all,

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:14.653 line:0%
Pennsylvania
has a long history of this,

00:19:14.653 --> 00:19:16.421 line:0%
especially
in the Philadelphia area.

00:19:16.421 --> 00:19:18.990
-First of all, I didn't know
Colonel Sanders had a son.

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:20.124
[ Southern accent ]
We're projecting a lead

00:19:20.124 --> 00:19:21.827
of 11 herbs and spices

00:19:21.827 --> 00:19:24.462
for the president
on election night.

00:19:24.462 --> 00:19:28.065
If you don't believe me,
just ask my droopy bowtie.

00:19:28.065 --> 00:19:30.936
Second, no, there is no history
of this blatant lie

00:19:30.936 --> 00:19:32.638
you're repeating
on national cable TV

00:19:32.638 --> 00:19:34.439
and why are Fox's
supposed news anchors

00:19:34.439 --> 00:19:35.707
taking this guy seriously?

00:19:35.707 --> 00:19:37.342
Is it possible they're
not actually news anchors,

00:19:37.342 --> 00:19:39.243
but party hacks hired
to do Trump's bidding?

00:19:39.243 --> 00:19:40.812
Or, to put it in Trump-speak --

00:19:40.812 --> 00:19:42.347
if you turn on on Fox News,

00:19:42.347 --> 00:19:44.081
you have all these
professional liars...

00:19:44.081 --> 00:19:46.018
-Saying, "What happened?"

00:19:46.018 --> 00:19:47.986
And then, they said, "Oh..."

00:19:47.986 --> 00:19:49.955
-In fact, the Republicans
are the ones responsible

00:19:49.955 --> 00:19:51.389
for the delays
in ballot counting

00:19:51.389 --> 00:19:52.824
they're now complaining about.

00:19:52.824 --> 00:19:54.893
We could've started counting
all these early mail ballots

00:19:54.893 --> 00:19:56.427
in states like Michigan
and Pennsylvania

00:19:56.427 --> 00:19:59.097
before Election Day,
but Republicans refused.

00:19:59.097 --> 00:20:00.598 line:0%
-You may be thinking,
"Why are we still waiting

00:20:00.598 --> 00:20:02.367 line:0%
to hear from Michigan
and why are they still

00:20:02.367 --> 00:20:04.770 line:0%
counting our ballots?"
Well, for about 18 months,

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:07.338 line:0%
the election clerks throughout
the state of Michigan and I

00:20:07.338 --> 00:20:08.973 line:0%
called on our
state legislature

00:20:08.973 --> 00:20:10.876 line:0%
to update our laws
to provide time

00:20:10.876 --> 00:20:13.444 line:0%
for pre-processing of ballots
that were on par

00:20:13.444 --> 00:20:15.948 line:0%
with many other states,
like our neighbors in Ohio,

00:20:15.948 --> 00:20:17.482 line:0%
who were able to count
the vast majority

00:20:17.482 --> 00:20:19.150 line:0%
of their ballots yesterday.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.285 line:0%
Now, our state legislature

00:20:20.285 --> 00:20:22.687 line:0%
chose not to make
that change to our laws.

00:20:22.687 --> 00:20:24.489
-Yeah!
They're the ones who said no

00:20:24.489 --> 00:20:26.258
to counting mail ballots
before Election Day

00:20:26.258 --> 00:20:28.160
and, now, they're
the ones claiming a delay

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:30.094
in counting mail ballots
is somehow suspicious.

00:20:30.094 --> 00:20:31.796
That's the con they're running.

00:20:31.796 --> 00:20:33.966 line:0%
It reminds me of that classic
Supreme Court case...

00:20:36.134 --> 00:20:37.869 line:0%
It will take time
to fully process

00:20:37.869 --> 00:20:40.372
the results of this election,
and that's normal and routine

00:20:40.372 --> 00:20:41.440
and that's how it should work.

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:42.941
Every ballot must be counted

00:20:42.941 --> 00:20:45.410
and we can't let Trump cheat
or discredit those ballots.

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:47.746
Moreover,
Biden appears to have won

00:20:47.746 --> 00:20:49.714
a sizable popular vote
victory over Trump,

00:20:49.714 --> 00:20:52.317
who's running behind many
down-ballot Republicans.

00:20:52.317 --> 00:20:54.586
Will the Democrats have
some soul searching to do?

00:20:54.586 --> 00:20:57.355
Sure. But was Trump
repudiated last night?

00:20:57.355 --> 00:20:58.723
We're still awaiting
final results,

00:20:58.723 --> 00:21:01.059
but it's very much looking
like that's what happened.

00:21:01.059 --> 00:21:02.994
If Trump had any
self-awareness at all,

00:21:02.994 --> 00:21:05.330
he'd look at the state he's left
the country in and say...

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:07.032
-I shouldn't even be here.

00:21:07.032 --> 00:21:08.733
